# The left end of a counter run: stone top, ash door, chrome handle. Place it
# flipped for the right end. Things set on it use origin <height + 2> to sit on
# the slab, back from its edge.
sprite kitchen-counter-end
size 16 32
layer object
footprint 1 1
origin 0 16
tag counter kitchen
variant teal A=T a=t 4=6

frame default
